Results of the MRO in reinforcement learning. The suffixes “-RS” and “-RL” denote the results obtained using rejection sampling with <math id="A3.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=4</annotation></semantics></math> and reinforcement learning, respectively.
