</section>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Ablation Study</h3>

<div id="A3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this subsection, we design several MRO variants to further describe the functionality of intra-sequence and inter-sequence rewards, as well as SGRO.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Reward Design.</h5>

<div id="A3.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Table <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Reward Design. ‣ C.3 Ablation Study ‣ Appendix C Experiments ‣ MRO: Enhancing Reasoning in Diffusion Language Models via Multi-Reward Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, we design six MRO variants to investigate the impacts of intra-sequence and inter-sequence rewards.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T5" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A3.T5.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:258.8pt;height:32.9pt;vertical-align:-14.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-64.3pt,8.2pt) scale(0.668172067042276,0.668172067042276) ;">
<table id="A3.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A3.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Reward\Variant</th>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">MRO-v1</td>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">MRO-v2</td>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">MRO-v3</td>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">MRO-v4</td>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">MRO-v5</td>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">MRO-v6</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t"><math id="A3.T5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{t}^{\text{tv}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>tv</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{t}^{\text{tv}}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">✓</td>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_border_t"></td>
<td id="A3.T5.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_border_t"></td>
