<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Ablation study of SGRO.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Step-wise Group Reward Optimization.</h5>

<div id="A3.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also conduct an ablation study on our SGRO. Specifically, we test the case where SGRO is not applied, meaning that each denoising step receives a shaping reward in rejection sampling. As shown in Table <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Reward Design. ‣ C.3 Ablation Study ‣ Appendix C Experiments ‣ MRO: Enhancing Reasoning in Diffusion Language Models via Multi-Reward Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, we find that SGRO is effective and helps the MRO achieve better performance.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Analysis</h2>

<figure id="A4.T7" class="ltx_table ltx_align_floatright" style="width:47%;">
<div id="A4.T7.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:165.6pt;height:82.6pt;vertical-align:-39.4pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-27.5pt,13.7pt) scale(0.750445281632767,0.750445281632767) ;">
<table id="A4.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A4.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Model/Length</span></th>
<th id="A4.T7.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" colspan="2">GSM8K</th>
<th id="A4.T7.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" colspan="2">MATH500</th></tr>
<tr id="A4.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T7.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">256</th>
<th id="A4.T7.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">512</th>
